s it, so left alone it grows for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"life of the app — deciding that policy is the library’s job, not each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CloudKit-mirrored store is never pruned"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", by this or by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/historyRetention","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and calling this on one returns 0. Mirroring reads","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the same transaction log to decide what to export, there is no API to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ask how far it has got, and deleting a transaction it has not yet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exported resets the sync state and forces a full re-upload. Apple’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"samples don’t prune mirrored stores either. Unpruned history is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status quo; a broken export is not."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The transaction the current watermark names, and everything after it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is kept whatever its age. On a store nobody has written to for longer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the retention window, the launch anchor "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}]},{"type":"text","text":" one of the doomed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transactions, and pruning it would expire the watermark hydration just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"installed."}]},{